ec. 403 (a ). The Wage Stabilization \nBoard created by section 403 (b) of the \nDefense Production Act of 1950, as \namended, shall be composed of eighteen\n(18) members, who shall be appointed by \nthe President by and with the advice and \nconsent of the Senate. The said Board \nshall be composed in equal numbers of \nmembers representative of the general \npublic, members representative of labor, \nand members representative of business \nand industry. A Chairman and a Vice \nChairman of the Board shall be desig­\nnated by the President from among the \nmembers representative of the general \npublic.\n“ (b). In performing any of its func­\ntions, the Wage Stabilization Board shall \nbe under the supervision and direction \nof the Economic Stabilization Adminis­\ntrator.”","original_source":{"page_or_item":"17 FR 6891, PDF pages 1-1; Sec. 2","sha256":"3f4aff9933d06b7cda12779fa6dac0d802cb049cb04fa0d18801540bd5f05c26","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1952-07-29/pdf/FR-1952-07-29.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:10377#sec2","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"S ec. 3. To the extent that provisions \nof prior Executive orders or proclama­\ntions, or parts thereof, are in conflict \nwith this order, the latter shall control, \nand any such prior provisions are \namended accordingly.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"17 FR 6891, PDF pages 1-1; Sec. 3","sha256":"3f4aff9933d06b7cda12779fa6dac0d802cb049cb04fa0d18801540bd5f05c26","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1952-07-29/pdf/FR-1952-07-29.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:10377#sec3","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"S ec. 4. This order shall become effec­\ntive on July 30, 1952.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"17 FR 6891, PDF pages 1-1; Sec. 4","sha256":"3f4aff9933d06b7cda12779fa6dac0d802cb049cb04fa0d18801540bd5f05c26","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/